= render 'shared/support_page', page_title: 'Hardware Support', current_page: 'Hardware Support', page_subtitle: 'Get help with hardware issues for your Baldrick board', document_title: 'Hardware Support', meta: ['Christmas Triage', 'Hardware only', '24–48 hour response'], toc: support_hardware_toc do
  p.lead If you are having a hardware issue with your Baldrick board, open a case in Christmas Triage. You'll describe the problem, we'll triage it, and you can track progress and replies in one place.

  .prose.support-prose
    section#triage
      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"
        div
          span.lbl Open a support case
          p.bd Use Christmas Triage to report hardware issues, get help from our team, and see suggested solutions. Create a case with your email and problem details — no separate form to fill.
          = link_to new_triage_case_path, class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
            | Open a triage case
            span.ar →

      .callout.warn
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"
        div
          span.lbl Important
          p.bd
            | Our team cannot help with software or sequence issues via triage. Join our
            = link_to ' Facebook community', t('facebook_group_url'), target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', class: 'lnk'
            |  for software questions, sequences and general help.

    section#options
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Alternatives
        | Other support options

      .next-grid
        = link_to t('facebook_group_url'), class: 'next-card', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
          .top
            span.kind Community
            span.go →
          h4 Facebook group
          p Software questions, sequence help and discussions — our team hangs out there too.
        = link_to fun_stuff_path, class: 'next-card' do
          .top
            span.kind Docs
            span.go →
          h4 Fun stuff & FAQ
          p Setup guides, release notes, dimensions and the general FAQ.
        = link_to support_software_path, class: 'next-card' do
          .top
            span.kind Software
            span.go →
          h4 Software support
          p Why we route setup questions through the community.
        = link_to support_asking_for_help_path, class: 'next-card' do
          .top
            span.kind Checklist
            span.go →
          h4 Asking for help
          p Run through this before posting for faster answers.

    section#scope
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Scope
        | What we can help with

      .spec-grid
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77A6 6 0 0 1 21 12v1M4 11h7M4 15h4"
          h4 Hardware issues
          ul
            li Physical damage or defects
            li Power supply problems
            li Connection issues
            li Component failures
            li Manufacturing defects
            li Warranty claims
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M9.5 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 4.2 1.8c-.8.7-1.7 1.2-1.7 2.7M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0z"
          h4 Software & sequences
          p For these issues, please use our Facebook community:
          ul
            li xLights configuration
            li Sequence creation
            li Network setup
            li Firmware updates
            li Web interface issues
            li General questions

    section#before
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Prep
        | Before contacting support

      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
            path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
        div
          span.lbl Quick tips
          p.bd Check our documentation and Facebook community first. Many common issues have already been solved and documented.

      .rn-subcard
        h4 Check these first
        ul
          li Verify power supply connections and voltage
          li Check all cable connections
          li Ensure proper mounting and ventilation
          li Review our troubleshooting guides
          li Search the Facebook community for similar issues

      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"
        div
          span.lbl Response time
          p.bd We typically respond to triage cases within 24–48 hours during business days.

      .pullquote
        span.qm “
        blockquote For urgent hardware issues, the Facebook community is often the fastest way to get help from both our team and experienced builders.
        cite — The Baldrick team

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Need software help instead?
    p Setup and sequence questions are best handled in the community.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to support_software_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Software support
        span.ar →
      = link_to t('facebook_group_url'), class: 'btn btn-clear', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
        | Join Facebook group
